## 7. Feature reduction

Method: (1) drop one of each highly correlated pair (|Spearman| &ge; {{corr_thr}}): {{n_feat}} to {{n_corr}} features; (2) rank the rest by permutation importance on validation data; (3) keep the smallest set that works about as well: **{{k_sel}} features**. All learned models were re-tuned and evaluated with the same rules.

